linux-admin-center (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add initial Debian and Ubuntu package support.
  * Build an architecture-independent package from the existing DESTDIR
    layout.
  * Keep package removal under apt and dpkg control instead of installing
    lac-uninstall.
  * Detect and block conflicting manual /usr/local installations before
    package installation.
  * Mark package-managed installations for the LAC Self Check.
  * Add the lac(1) manual page and Debian package metadata.
  * Validate build, install, reinstall, removal and configuration preservation
    in CI and on the development workstation.

